    "The proposal would lead to a detrimental impact on the amenity of the first floor flat at no.168a,and the flats beyond, in terms of disturbance, loss of outlook, overshadowing with an overbearing impact and sense of enclosure that would have a significant adverse effect on the amenities of these adjacent occupiers contrary to Policy 7 of the Havering Local Plan and the Residential Extensions and Alterations Supplementary Planning Document.",
